            "role": "N",
            "text": "1985年，《赛博格宣言》进入了人工智能与人文想象的历史。它提出了怎样的问题，又为什么值得我们今天重新回看？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "唐娜·哈拉维以赛博格打破人／动物、自然／技术和身体／机器的二元边界，为后人类主义、人机融合与身体增强讨论提供重要思想资源。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-humanistic-1985-cyborg-manifesto-record"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-humanistic-1985-cyborg-manifesto-core"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "作品或理论把人工制造、自动行动或计算过程转化为对主体性、理解与社会秩序的追问。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-humanistic-1985-cyborg-manifesto-record"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-humanistic-1985-cyborg-manifesto-core"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "研究者通常把这一节点视为 AI 人文史中的重要文化参照，而不是现代技术的直接预言。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-humanistic-1985-cyborg-manifesto-record"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-humanistic-1985-cyborg-manifesto-core"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "回看《赛博格宣言》，重要的不只是作品、理论或事件本身，更是它让人们重新思考机器、心智与人的关系。它留下的问题，至今仍在人工智能的文化讨论中不断回响。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-humanistic-1985-cyborg-manifesto-record"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-humanistic-1985-cyborg-manifesto-core"],
